  "project_description": "Commerce Promo Bar allows stores to display notifications and promotional information via the bar on top pages or any positions.\n\n Highlight your product promotions, sales, other offers, general notification, and potential delays. Add a countdown timer to any promo bar.\n\n Customization:\n\n \n Multiple promo bars can be stacked \n One block to display all promo bars \n Configurable background and text color from UI \n Configurable countdown from UI \n WYSIWYG editor to style promo bar message \n Simple Twig template for advanced modifications \n Option to use tokens from related Commerce Promotion \n Fieldable entity, so you can with tokens insert any added field value to the output of promo bar \n \n \n\n Available restrictions are per::\n\n \n Commerce store \n Customer role \n Start and end date \n Path restrictions",
